@startuml seq-uc01
' Figure 5.2.1 Analysis sequence diagram for UC-01 Find Recipes Using Available Ingredients
' Numbered messages match the scenario table rows in 5.2.1 (b). Dashed returns carry no number.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
hide footbox
actor User
participant "SearchPanel" as SP
participant ":Search" as S
participant "RecipeCatalog" as RC
participant "MatchScorer" as MS
participant ":MatchResult" as MR

User -> SP : 1 submits search criteria\n(ingredients, mode, preferences)
activate SP
SP -> S ** : 2 records a new search
SP -> RC : 3 asks for recipes that use\nany submitted ingredient
RC --> SP : candidate recipes
SP -> MS : 4 asks to score and rank the\ncandidates under the search mode
activate MS
MS -> MR ** : 5 creates a match result for\neach qualifying recipe
MS --> SP : ranked match results
deactivate MS
SP -> User : 6 displays matching recipes\n(title, source reference, match score)
deactivate SP
@enduml
